{$z_{2,r}$ to $z_{3,r}^{-1}$, maps $z_{3,r}$ to $z_{2,r}$} and fixes the remaining elements of $Z$. 
Consider the commutator 
$\beta= \alpha \tau \alpha^{-1} \tau^{-1}$.} 

