\begin{defn} We denote $\mr{ProFin} := \mr{Pro(Fin)}$ to be the Pro-category of the category of finite sets. This is an ordinary category whose objects are cofiltered diagrams $S = (S_i)_{i \in I}$ of finite sets $S_i$, and whose morphisms are $$\Hom_{\mr{ProFin}}((T_j)_{j \in J}, (S_i)_{i \in I}) = \lim_{i \in I} \underset{j \in J}\colim \Hom_{\mr{Fin}}(T_j, S_i).$$
