$\mr{Shv}(\mc{X}, \mc{V}) \simeq \mr{HypSh}(\mc{C}, \mc{V}).$
\end{lemma}

\begin{defn} We define \begin{align*} 
D(-, R) \colon \mr{Cond(Ani)}^{op} &\to \mr{Cat} \\
X & \mapsto D(X, R)
\end{align*} as the hypercomplete sheaf of categories associated to the sheaf in definition \ref{firsttry} by lemma \ref{a4}. 
