In the concluding remarks, we summarize the known results on embeddings of Banach algebras inducing isomorphisms in K-theory, in particular by J.-B. Bost \cite{JBB} on the Oka principle, and by V. Lafforgue \cite{Laff} on the Baum-Connes conjecture.

