    \mathbb{E}_{\mathbb{P}}\left[ \sup_{t \in [0, T]} \left \vert \mathscr{M}_t \right\vert\right] <\infty.
  \end{align*} 
  For $i=1,...,d$ we get for $\mathscr{M}^{1,i}$
