\begin{defin}\label{Def_RepresentationsWedge}
For all $i \in \{1, \dots, k\}$ let $\delta_i : \subseteq \baire \to X$ be a representation of the set $X$.
We define the representation $\delta_1 \wedge \dots \wedge \delta_k$ of the set $X$ by
