$\delta'_{C_c(\RR^n)} (\langle p,q\rangle) = f$ if and only if $\psi(q) =\dom(f)$ and for all $k = \langle i, j \rangle$, $k \in \ran(p)$ exactly when $B_i\cap \dom(f)\neq\emptyset$ and $f(\overline{B_i}) \subseteq B_j$.
