			Let $X,Y\geq 0$.
			For any $s\in[0,1]$ and any function $g$ on an interval $\mathcal{J}$, where $\spec(X)\subseteq \mathcal{J}$, such that $x\mapsto x^sg(x)$ is nonnegative and nonincreasing, then 
			\begin{align*}
				\Tr\left[ g(X) \left(X^{\nicefrac{1}{2}} Y X^{\nicefrac{1}{2}} \right)^s \right]
