  \item We propose some algorithmic changes to the shifted
    Cholesky~QR algorithm which imrpove its numerical robustness and
    performance in certain contexts.
  \item We execute a thorough
    performance comparison in a situation where only vector-wise access to the
    matrix columns is allowed.
  \end{itemize}
}
