The worst case merge tree depth is fixed by the tokenizer, so this check can be done in constant time.\footnote{We generally expect the depth of the merge trees to scale with the logarithm of the vocabulary size \(V\), although we ignore scaling with respect to the tokenizer's parameters for brevity.}
