\begin{definition}
A $2$-representation of $\Ucat(\mf{g})$ is a graded additive $\Bbbk$-linear $2$-functor $\Ucat(\mf{g}) \to \mathcal{K}$ for some graded, additive $2$-category $\mathcal{K}$.
